constraints:
1 ≤ Number of nodes ≤ 10^{5}
1 ≤ Data of a node ≤ 10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(N)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def preOrder(self, root):
		if not root:
			return None
		st = []
		ans = []
		st.append(root)
		while st:
			ans.append(st[-1].data)
			node = st.pop()
			if node.right:
				st.append(node.right)
			if node.left:
				st.append(node.left)
		return ans
